{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JDG","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"士师记","commonName":"士师记","title":"士师记","order":7,"numberOfChapters":21,"sha256":"b41549e1798366ee29bb3d2292f8b33fc93f2b80c2c101beb91358b529c88503","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":21,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/21.json","totalNumberOfVerses":616},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米迦的神像"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以法莲山区住了一个名叫米迦的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他对母亲说：“你那一千一百块银子被拿走了，你因此说了咒诅的话，我都听见了。看啊，银子在我这里，是我拿去的。”他母亲说：“我儿啊，愿耶和华赐福给你！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["米迦把一千一百块银子还给母亲。他母亲说：“我要为我儿把这些银子献给耶和华，用来雕刻、铸造神像。我会把银子交还给你。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["米迦把银子还给母亲后，他母亲拿出二百块银子交给银匠雕刻、铸造神像，放在米迦的房子里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["米迦有一个神庙，他制造了一件以弗得和一些家庭神像，并指派他的一个儿子做祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那时，以色列没有王，人人各行其是。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["犹大的伯利恒住着一个年轻的利未人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他离开伯利恒想到别的地方居住，一路走到以法莲山区米迦的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["米迦问他：“你从哪里来？”他回答说：“我是从犹大的伯利恒来的利未人，要找一个住的地方。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["米迦说：“你就住在我这里吧，做我的师父和祭司。我每年给你十块银子，还为你提供衣服和饮食。”利未人就进了米迦的家，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["住了下来。米迦待他就像待自己的儿子一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["这样，米迦派他做祭司，让他住在自己家里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["米迦说：“现在我有一个利未人做我的祭司，我知道耶和华一定会恩待我。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JDG/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}